sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Usuario
    participant S as SPA Vue
    participant A as API Laravel<br/>(CompetitionController)
    participant Q as CompetitionDetail<br/>(consulta)
    participant I as ImportCompetition<br/>(comando)
    participant B as RequestBudget<br/>(Redis)
    participant F as FootballDataClient
    participant FD as football-data.org
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant E as Evento / Listener
    participant W as Worker (cola)

    U->>S: Abre "Premier League"
    S->>A: GET /competitions/PL (Bearer token)
    A->>A: auth:api · active · can:competitions.read
    A->>Q: handle("PL")
    Q->>DB: Competition::reference("PL")
    alt importada y fresca
        DB-->>Q: liga + equipos
        Q-->>A: QueryResult(source=database)
    else no importada o vencida
        Q->>I: handle("PL")
        I->>F: competitionSquads("PL")
        F->>B: acquire()
        alt hay cupo
            B-->>F: ok (registra el hit)
            F->>FD: GET /v4/competitions/PL/teams (X-Auth-Token)
            FD-->>F: 200 competition + teams + squad
            F->>B: sincroniza con X-Requests-Available-Minute
            F-->>I: CompetitionSquads (DTO de dominio)
            I->>DB: transacción: upsert competition, teams, players · sync pivot
            I-)E: CompetitionImported
            E->>DB: competition_imports (auditoría)
            I-->>Q: Competition
            Q-->>A: QueryResult(source=football-data)
        else sin cupo
            B-->>F: FootballDataRateLimited(retryAfter)
            Q-)W: ImportCompetitionJob::dispatch("PL")
            Q-->>A: 429 (o 200 stale si había copia)
            Note over W,FD: El worker reintenta cuando se libera un cupo<br/>(release con retryAfter) y la próxima consulta ya sale de la BD
        end
    end
    A-->>S: JSON { data, meta } · mismo formato de error siempre
    S-->>U: Equipos de la liga (o cuenta regresiva y reintento automático)
